{"root":"bedebah","ipa":"/bəˈdɛbah/","core":"指代卑鄙、无赖、混蛋的人，常用于表达强烈的蔑视或愤怒，带有粗俗色彩。","pos":["名词","形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/bəˈdɛbah/","zh":"混蛋，卑鄙小人","phrases":[{"t":"dasar bedebah","zh":"真是个混蛋"},{"t":"si bedebah itu","zh":"那个卑鄙的家伙"},{"t":"perilaku bedebah","zh":"卑劣的行为"}],"examples":[{"t":"Jangan percaya pada orang bedebah itu.","zh":"别相信那个卑鄙小人。"},{"t":"Dia merasa dikhianati oleh temannya yang bedebah.","zh":"他感到被那个混蛋朋友背叛了。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"bedebah","ipa":"/bəˈdɛbah/","zh":"混蛋，卑鄙的","phrase":{"t":"mulut bedebah","zh":"满嘴胡言的家伙"},"example":{"t":"Dasar bedebah, beraninya kau menipuku!","zh":"你这个混蛋，竟敢骗我！"}},{"w":"kebedebahan","ipa":"/kəbədɛbaˈhan/","zh":"卑鄙的行为，混蛋行径","phrase":{"t":"segala kebedebahan","zh":"所有的卑劣行径"},"example":{"t":"Masyarakat muak dengan segala kebedebahan yang dilakukan koruptor itu.","zh":"公众对那个贪官所做的一切卑劣行径感到厌恶。"}}],"derSlugs":["bedebah","kebedebahan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-28T08:30:17.644Z","src":"base"}